{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And we shall live.</b> A spark of the Holy Spirit flickered in him — through this journey your spirit shall revive, as it is said, ״וַתְּחִי רוּחַ יַעֲקֹב אֲבִיהֶם״ (Genesis 45)." "<b>And we shall not die.</b> Of famine. Benjamin — perhaps he will be taken, perhaps he will not be taken, but we all die of famine if we do not go. Better to let the uncertain go and take hold of the certain."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:17.820782053Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}